{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — A gentle, integrated approach</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Holistic, whole-person care and educational events in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Workshops, intake series, and follow-ups to support resilience and balance.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
  <script defer src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</head>
<body class="layout-zen">
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="/">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
      <button class="nav-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Open navigation">☰</button>
      <nav class="nav">
        <a href="services.html">Care</a>
        <a href="conditions.html">Concerns</a>
        <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Fees</a>
        <a href="about.html">Our Story</a>
        <a href="book.html" class="primary">Reserve</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section id="hero" class="hero">
      <svg class="pattern" aria-hidden="true"><use href="assets/img/pattern.svg#p"></use></svg>
      <div class="wrap hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1 class="title">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
          <p class="subtitle">{{TAGLINE}}</p>
          <p class="lead">Join our events series and one-on-one intakes to build lasting habits for sleep, energy, digestion and resilience. Education first — tailored planning second.</p>
          <div class="hero-ctas">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <a class="btn" href="book.html">Book a series</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <aside class="hero-meta">
          <div class="meta-card">
            <strong>Phone</strong>
            <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a>
          </div>
          <div class="meta-card">
            <strong>Email</strong>
            <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a>
          </div>
          <div class="meta-card">
            <strong>Location</strong>
            <span>{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</span>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="myth_vs_truth" class="card-section">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Myths & gentle clarifications</h2>
        <div class="grid-3">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Myth — One fix fixes all</h3>
            <p>Truth: healing is layered. We prioritize education and small, measurable steps rather than quick promises.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Myth — Natural means risk-free</h3>
            <p>Truth: natural approaches can interact with meds or conditions. We review context and safety in every plan.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Myth — Tests always tell the story</h3>
            <p>Truth: optional labs can inform care but are used alongside history, lifestyle, and listening.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="pillars" class="pillars">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Four guiding pillars</h2>
        <div class="grid-4">
          <div class="pillar">
            <h4>Listen</h4>
            <p>Comprehensive intake that honors your story and priorities.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar">
            <h4>Educate</h4>
            <p>Evidence-informed teaching so you can choose with clarity.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar">
            <h4>Plan</h4>
            <p>Small, measurable steps tailored to daily life and rhythms.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar">
            <h4>Support</h4>
            <p>Follow-ups, adjustments, and community events to sustain change.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="case_notes" class="case-notes card-section">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Case notes — anonymized, educational</h2>
        <p class="muted">Below are short, de-identified vignettes from our workshop and intake series meant for learning. They are not guarantees and do not replace medical advice.</p>
        <div class="notes">
          <article class="note">
            <h3>Evening rhythm for sleep</h3>
            <p>A participant in our sleep series decreased nighttime screen time, introduced a 20-minute wind-down ritual, and tracked sleep patterns. Education around sleep stages helped set expectations; progress was incremental and individualized.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="note">
            <h3>Digestive resilience</h3>
            <p>Through dietary journaling and paced breath work, someone with intermittent bloating learned to identify triggers, added gentle fiber changes, and consulted their primary care for testing when warranted.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="note">
            <h3>Energy and pacing</h3>
            <p>Participants in an energy-focused series used activity mapping and micro-rests to redistribute effort across the day, supported by gentle nutritional education and check-ins.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="faq" class="faq card-section">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Questions we often hear</h2>
        <div class="accordion" role="tablist">
          <div class="qa">
            <button class="q" aria-expanded="false">Do you offer one-off visits or only series?</button>
            <div class="a">We offer both single intakes and multi-session event-series. Series are excellent for skill-building; single visits are for focused planning.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="qa">
            <button class="q" aria-expanded="false">Will you diagnose or prescribe?</button>
            <div class="a">Education and whole-person planning are central. When medications or diagnoses are involved, we coordinate with your medical providers and prioritize safety.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="qa">
            <button class="q" aria-expanded="false">Are labs required?</button>
            <div class="a">Optional labs may be suggested for clarity. They are educational tools and never mandatory for participation in events.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="cta" class="cta">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Join a mindful series or schedule an intake</h2>
        <p class="muted">Small cohorts, focused topics, and ongoing support. Practical education to carry home.</p>
        <div class="cta-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a class="btn" href="book.html">Reserve a spot</a>
        </div>
        <p class="credit">Led by {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} — community-centered, safety-minded.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p>© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Educational holistic care in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. No guarantees. Consult your clinician for medical decisions.</p>
      <nav class="foot-nav">
        <a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>"} 
